OL,3,GNEWSAArchbishop sets off on 'inspiring'
OL,4,A25-mile pilgrimage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Archbishop of York has begun a
OL,7,F25-mile walk on an ancient pilgrimage
OL,8,Froute across the Isle of Man.
OL,10,FThe Most Reverend Stephen Cottrell was
OL,11,Fjoined by the Bishop of Sodor and Man,
OL,12,Fthe Rt Revd Patricia Hillas, and 100
OL,13,Fpilgrims.
OL,15,F"There are tears and laughter and
OL,16,Fbeautiful walks," the archbishop told
OL,17,Fthe BBC. "It is very inspiring."
OL,19,FHis three-day walk takes place during a
OL,20,Fweekend of pilgrimage, prayer and
OL,21,Fworship with churches and communities
OL,22,Fon the island.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
